<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-McPherson's half year net A$11.21 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-McPherson's half year net A$11.21 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 10.31 vs  7.25</p>
<p>    Net profit			 11.21 vs  6.90</p>
<p>    Sales			     127.87 vs 136.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   5.5 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: McPherson's Ltd is a maker and supplier of homeware products and tools.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
